cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "Bang's theorem in Lean 4"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 and Mathlib formalization of Bang's theorem on equifacial tetrahedra: a tetrahedron
  whose four faces have equal area has opposite edges equal in pairs. With the converse, and the
  corollary that the sum of the distances from a point to the four faces is constant exactly for
  such tetrahedra. No sorry, standard axioms only; re-checked by leanchecker and by the
  independent checker nanoda, with tamper tests.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: redzwn
  - name: "Claude (Anthropic)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/redzwn/bang-lean"
url: "https://bang-lean.pages.dev/"
